{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/XHWj_9xmuVhL2iBEMKt_7A","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:03.966084+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/XHWj_9xmuVhL2iBEMKt_7A","html":"<div><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/NyE1c4MDkiaxeqiaYeh81ibrnkhP7eTwibhMAqUeR8RxETNTo6iaavdncdz0l3iaKBYwlz3yIDElhPkeLmQWJ3KACGWw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>科创中国、万物互联、人工智能的时代背景下，我国创新驱动发展战略正以前所未有的速度和深度持续推进。硬科技领域的创新创业，将成为中国未来几十年的重要发展引擎。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>为此，天津大学宣怀学院联合多个专业学院共同实施“科创硕士项目”。该项目聚焦国家发展关键行业和重大战略需求，围绕前沿科学技术应用研究和成果转化，面向电子信息、材料与化工等专业招收科创方向硕士生，打造专业教育与创业教育深度融合的创新创业人才培养体系，培养懂技术、懂创业，具有突出的企业家精神，能够推动科技成果转化落地，引领未来新兴产业发展的科技创业复合型人才，孵化科技创业家。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>一、基本资格条件</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导、愿为祖国建设服务、品德良好、遵纪守法的中国公民，且满足以下条件：</span></span></p><p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>在目前就读学校有机会取得教育部推荐免试研究生资格的优秀应届本科毕业生（含天津大学本校生）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.对科技领域创新创业具有浓厚兴趣，具有一定创造力和创业意愿；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.诚实守信，学风端正，不存在任何有违学术道德、专业伦理等行为；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.身心健康，符合国家和我校规定的体检要求。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>二、招收专业</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/8m5Ypga0P6nLgzs66uIcia4mJkeu6FYD5dN3jSTFODKzr0xZCphAkfGcTdtRkoYuUmiaPug9L7Vdy7BWZA4d5lCYBOmC6F0f9gThCKfCKf0Y4/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>注：</span></span><span><span>学生学籍归属于专业学院。学生完成各培养环节并达到申请学位基本条件，可获得专业学院颁发的毕业证书和专业学位证书，并获得宣怀学院颁发的科创硕士项目证书。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>三、申报流程</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>1.申请人需填写下述链接/二维码报名表单：</span><span>https://ff.lingxi360.com/f?fid=dJB8ZYdJ3ZUme&amp;utm_bccid=LXE6FJi_Ez5h8dP_</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/8m5Ypga0P6nia9ib0NDdekFyz367KlricvI3q4PrklElmhHbj53Nbz5jMXbCTA3lfksYZPm9yGGicmvqtWhYicUhpbibVQNwnQ0k5dI2RccfFym2I/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>2.完成线上申请后，申请人需同步将个人简历及相关材料发送至宣怀学院邮箱：</span><span>xuanhuai@tju.edu.cn</span><span>，邮件主题统一为“</span><span>科创硕士推免-本科院校-拟报专业学院-姓名</span><span>”，具体材料包括：</span></span></p><p><span><span>（1）个人简历（一页以内）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（2）相关证明材料（创新成果、自主研发项目、创业项目、竞赛奖项等）。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>报名时间为</span><span>9月3日-8日</span><span>，学院</span></span><span><span>将会根据申请人报名情况收集信息，</span></span><span><span>组织考核选拔，具体工作安排另行通知。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>四、其他注意事项</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>1.面试工作将于线下进行；</span></span><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>2.本次线上报名用于前期报名登记、信息采集。申请人还需按照教育部、本科所在学校和省市招办要求在规定时间内登录教育部推荐免试服务系统，完成填报志愿、缴纳报名费、接受复试确认、接受待录取确认等环节，完成最终录取。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>五、联系方式</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>地址：</span><span>天津大学卫津路校区宣怀学院创新创业教育中心（25教学楼C304）</span></span></p><p><span><span>咨询电话：</span></span></p><p><span><span>崔老师 18920687099（8:30-16:30）</span></span></p><p><span><span>孔老师 13777803408（8:30-16:30）</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>科创硕士具体介绍请看下图</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/8m5Ypga0P6lXJ6Ml0iadxasMn2iaP9X0XAe0gWthH6kJu3JGa3HmdDKveoDHEk0lzzWbrdCzr6Xbx5IXGlnPUjoAWk0R9TnZeVibia790Mtk12M/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/8m5Ypga0P6nusqsX7UnweHxDlnI2MLrC7Eq5AQ9vQoF5Rib4KDh74ylofy7qMa4BNRmHia5O7sJhwhaPYAlKW5Rg35hpJGgygcltpVxJo2Q9o/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/8m5Ypga0P6muWJrZicleBYMVeDsOWKajxpMib3dfoVN2FPPAck1zIAWQoDlmP9Pved3Lq4P1CwltSzC4pyEP5Aoibja3kI0legBPAUgdVjvQCY/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/8m5Ypga0P6kCK0kfTO8SF1SpKAmuHicC6C23MTtpDcI04TeIoCjt5JLkGcwoG9vxr84YRiaQEeibRzk2gOrvRibXuuwZ3hCe6KGa7p6MmiaK1ibJY/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/8m5Ypga0P6nOmQO4icxIAFYvomkwAbd5gLF7VVgicicSLEV9q9YBTYneqhSGickOnaXMkf9ywFY4u7dBg5up9st2HYxf340sgaA8r9God45Na4A/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/8m5Ypga0P6kDlcRx5khicovTktgkQQMmAMrvUjYicXCicDiaL5GLxIqsmSqrF14QTph1nCiaJ6kSwZVQpe75yuN5ptOBeHMWjv5gbibbqADF0qhRA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/NyE1c4MDkiaxDnRkmhLdmzEB0icAhbqJo6SmgupX2s3f9CF5GiaBgOuqTkn18OUPOVI3R5o5OLcw9GM83wYGp4jhw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><span><span><span>文案：崔玥 穆怡</span></span></span></section><section><span><span><span>编辑：穆怡</span></span></span></section><section><span><span><span>校审：崔玥 孔清 郭龙 杜欣韵</span></span></span></section><section><span><span><span>终审：张琳</span></span></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"1ee6d6586824ad4d1570f3cae373d96c1e0c8d97c6a73362e4c0758c029c2678","textLength":1081,"sourceSha256":"fa2503634188f90b007716e1bb07a1153bafa350c0e8c57536344d6e9caafc58","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-c8ffa9c1e46baca539fd","title":"2026年天津大学宣怀学院2027级科创硕士推免预报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:03.966084+00:00"}
